      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَلَالٌ</span></b>  [<i>Dates in the state in which they are
termed</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَلَحٌ</span>, (JK, T, S, K,) in the dial. of the
people of El-Basrah; (T, TA;) i. e. <i>green dates:</i>
